      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f939e0ae6e3881d949b4344|full_name} Hello, the lighting of the world is fully baked with Bakery Mono SH maps, this issue is only present in Unity 2022.3.22f1 introduced by the latest Open Beta, no issue in live aka Unity 2022.3.6f1 so it may just be a bug with that new version of Unity and not the shaders, after testing other worlds the same issue could not be found, so I'll try to find another world with the issue and see what it could be if not the shader",
